# UI test: a `##` run before a parameter of a `def` (SC0194).
#
# `mcp-servers.md` Decision 7 lets a `tool` document each parameter, because
# each one becomes a described field of the schema its caller reads. It is
# scoped to `tool` on purpose, so that the general question of documenting a
# `def`'s parameters stays open and belongs to
# `strings-formatting-and-docs.md` §5.2 — whose attachment table this extends
# by exactly one row.
#
# No fix: moving prose from one comment into another is an edit, not a
# substitution, and a `= help:` line appearing here would be the regression.

def fit_peaks(
        ## The run identifier, as printed in the run log.
        run: String) -> Int:
    0
